    {
      "text": "巡街阻止抢劫、救市民，每次英雄行动都解锁新能力",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Stop robberies, rescue civilians, and fight crime your way. Every heroic act unlocks new abilities - become the hero Goldpine needs!",
