      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "超级英雄也要开出租、翻汉堡，拿工资付食物与装备账单",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Being a hero doesn’t pay the bills—so you’ll need a job to survive. Drive a taxi, flip burgers, or find other ways to earn money Every \"Gollar\" counts, whether it’s for food, or upgrading your gear. Balance your heroic duties with everyday struggles.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3531260/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "健康、卫生、精神状态与声望都要维持，忽视任何一项都会加难",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Manage your health, hygiene, mental state, and respect to stay at your best. Neglect them, and your journey becomes harder.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3531260/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
